{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galeid. is a story about one human and two friends traveling through a dying dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this strange, yet somehow cute, world at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 9 chapters in total, and Chapter 1, the prologue, is currently available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/009c76f000ea45a9e2018b46a1f70aac.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Galeid.?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:Good old fashioned! A JRPG with sluggish movement!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:Command battles that make good use of depression, hiss, mania, and attributes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:A slightly strange and eerie worldview!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:The only soothing thing! Cute characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:A surprisingly classic and easy-to-understand story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:Lots of bugs...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:Cats!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/65a982546fc34d333789ab07fdf4ac63.poster.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/65a982546fc34d333789ab07fdf4ac63.webm?t=1750750405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/65a982546fc34d333789ab07fdf4ac63.mp4?t=1750750405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...That's the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/50b72bb68be8d89b78cb66636a834bc7.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use attributes well! Easy-to-understand battle system!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Galeid.'s battles, you can use three main and two sub attributes depending on the enemy's characteristics,targeting or creating weak points as you fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/47154c1eee0c360267e770159c50df62.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I don't know which attribute is most effective!!!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry. In that case, just take a good look at the enemy's appearance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll surely find a clue.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/6ffa1773fe91c74eaa1482ebe3b2beb7.poster.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/6ffa1773fe91c74eaa1482ebe3b2beb7.webm?t=1750750405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/6ffa1773fe91c74eaa1482ebe3b2beb7.mp4?t=1750750405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/8de128d5e5ad0cf7001cdd827b8cb130.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You've finished all the chapters that have been released and there's nothing left to do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. Galeid. is packed with so many hidden elements that even the creator doesn't fully understand them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ask the residents, or investigate every suspicious place one by one,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and find the events that you don't understand in your own way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/8116cc1337b3f530971fdf51ae4b641e.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, as of Chapter 1, there are a total of <strong>10 secret bosses!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defeat all of the secret bosses, the game's current volume is about 4 to 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck with finding them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/6173b7e2e127ea070964fe5c79d88863.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >!This game has a bug!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major bugs have been fixed, but please make sure to back up your save data just in case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data location:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local files \u2192\u300cwww\u300d\u2192\u300csave\u300d\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please read the terms and conditions before streaming, creating derivative works, or creating multilingual patches!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galeid. welcomes live commentary, streaming, derivative works, and volunteer translations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is possible to monetize live commentary and live streaming... but!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before doing so, please check the terms and conditions of the linked website first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look!!! (Sorry, no English translation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358270?t=1750750405","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358270?t=1750750405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/bf061f063c49adab70458af820870ea9a63d0bd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750750405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/bf061f063c49adab70458af820870ea9a63d0bd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750750405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galeid. is a story about one human and two friends traveling through a dying dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this strange, yet somehow cute, world at your leisure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 9 chapters in total, and Chapter 1, the prologue, is currently available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358270/extras/009c76f000ea45a9e2018b46a1f70aac.avif?t=1750750405\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Galeid.?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>:Good old fashioned! A JRPG